I have just uploaded the linux port of the mmdf-IIB-4.3 mail system to
sunsite.unc.edu.  It is also available on Philadelphia.cursci.com in
pub/mmdf.

MMDF is a complete replacement for Sendmail, Smail and similar systems.
It features easy configuration files, UUCP, SMTP and Local mailers (there
are also CS-Net, PhoneNet and other gateways provided, but since I am
not hooked up to these systems, I did not port them). Also included is
a nice list-management system. An example configuration (mine actually)
is included with the distribution.

The package is source only.  If someone wants a binary distribution, please
let me know at adrian@cursci.com.

